mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\" fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" symmetric=\"true\"></mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Therefore, the missing expression is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"30\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
